  "question": {
    "text": "The system of equations&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has infinitely many solutions for",
